  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbt/sbt/zipball/v2.0.8",
  "body": "## 🐛 bug fixes\r\n\r\n* fix: Fixes `ThisBuild`-scoped bare settings by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9674\r\n* fix: Fixes `TestReportListener` not receiving endGroup after a LinkageError by @unkarjedy in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9667\r\n* fix: Fixes the ability to extend `TestResultLogger` by @unkarjedy in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9655\r\n* fix: Fixes `--addPluginSbtFile` getting lost after reboot by @azdrojowa123 in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9669\r\n* fix: Fixes JDK 17 domain socket deadlocks by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9671\r\n* fix: Keep adhoc test classloader open in a forked test @stasimus in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9639\r\n* fix: Fixes Windows runner by @eed3si9n in https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/9680\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/sbt/sbt/compare/v2.0.7...v2.0.8",
